// Public player portrait database for the unholy library.
//
// SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH: the class -> texture rows below are generated
// verbatim from src/acs_source/compat/mods/uix/uh_uix_mugshots.acs (the UIX
// v3bh PBMug_<Class> registry).  That file remains authoritative for UIX's
// Better Team Display; regenerate this fragment whenever it changes.  In the
// current resource set the DECORATE Player.ScoreIcon and the UIX mugshot use
// the same texture names for every registered class, so one table is enough.
// If a future class makes them diverge, split the table into separate
// score-icon and mugshot columns and commit both -- do not silently alias.
//
// Consumers:
//   1. SCORINFO UHPlayerIcon column (scoreboard_icons.acs)
//   2. Unholy native teammate bar mugshot (uh_teaminfo.acs)
//   3. UIX Better Team Display, which keeps its own PBMug_* scripts
//
// This fragment is textually #include'd by unholy/uh_teaminfo.acs; it is not
// a standalone library and must not be added to LOADACS.
//
// Missing mappings return an empty texture (never a wrong portrait) so a new
// class degrades to no icon instead of a mismatched one.

